      "content": "Trump Asks Why US Takes Immigrants From 'Sh*thouse' Countries Like Somalia: 'Why Not Denmark?' Search Query for Search the web Search with Yahoo Scout Search the web Skip to main Home News Finance Sports More Mail Search the web News US Politics Science World Weather Originals ... Advertisement Advertisement Return to Homepage Top Stories: Meghan Markle's father Obama slams Ramaswamy ad California ballots Musk admits Starlink slowdown Trump might move press corps U.S. embassy alert Voter ID rules World Series guide Kushner disputes report Who is Mike Rogers? Follow Trump Asks Why US Takes Immigrants From 'Sh*thouse' Countries Like Somalia: 'Why Not Denmark?' Mediaite Updated Sun, October 25, 2026 at 12:23 AM UTC Add Yahoo as a preferred source to see more of our stories on Google. President Donald Trump told a Georgia crowd he wants more immigrants from countries like Norway and Sweden — and not sh*thouse nations like Somalia Advertisement About Our Ads About Our Ads Advertisement Advertisement Advertisement Yahoo! US Politics 2024 Election World Health Science The 360 Contact Us Originals Help Share Your Feedback About Us About Our Ads Site Map Follow us on Download our app © 2026 Yahoo. All rights reserved. View comments",
